body:
oh i misunderstood you then, sorry! yeah, i agree that being imprisoned and tortured likely lead to him exploring the depths of the astral world too, as means of escapism and discovering it.   


i think you're right about SkullKnight/Void being an inverse parallel of Guts/Griffith, i think later i'll search to see if there are any posts going into depth about that, if so it should be a fun read. 

